    "description": "Lay Healer Base 4.6 - Prosthetics. Spells for measuring, molding and fitting artificial limbs (wood, glass, metal, enchanted materials), covering them with artificial flesh, and animating them for increasing durations. Special Notes: Once created, a false limb is no longer magical. However, the animation of the limb is magical (and can be dispelled). When resisting Cancel and Dispel, an animated false limb gets an additional +50 RR modification.",
    "spells": [
      {
        "name": "01. Measure",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 1,
          "area_of_effect": "caster",
          "duration": "—",
          "range": "touch",
          "type": "I",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Caster knows the proper dimensions needed to make a false limb for the target."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "02. Mold Wood",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 2,
          "area_of_effect": "caster",
          "duration": "1 hr/lvl (C)",
          "range": "self",
          "type": "U",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Caster may mold target wood (up to 4 cubic feet) as if it were clay when he concentrates. It normally takes 1 day (approximately 8 hours) to mold an artificial limb. At the end of the molding time, the target wood returns its normal hardness."
        }
      },
